{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 55","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_55&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29ab3e1eecd4bd8bb9c9d20855ffed7dfc40ffc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle XOY$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> be a right-angled triangle with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/2925373c505644ba5b771232a94340e152c1a280.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle XOY=90^\\circ$\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the midpoints of legs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/9/4a903f7c677cbaadb6e72741b95730648ab1d442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OX$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8afe773cd5709ee6b1f9f84680829802825cfab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OY$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, respectively. Find the length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> given that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2925500523561d262c6362606f6bfbfb83ae0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XN=22$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/b/3fb36040e14c801985b5ebfe7e207c52502aed33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YM=31$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_55&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/f/a8f9f96de0e77b2948ae6e313b6b3b3dae94a85d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  pair O=(0,0),X=(0,60),Y=(80,0),M=(0,30),N=(40,0); draw((0,5)--(5,5)--(5,0)); draw(O--X--Y--O); draw(X--N); draw(Y--M); dot(O); label(&quot;O&quot;,O,SW); dot(M); label(&quot;M&quot;,M,W); dot(X); label(&quot;X&quot;,X,NW); dot(N); label(&quot;N&quot;,N,S); dot(Y); label(&quot;Y&quot;,Y,SE);  label(&quot;a&quot;,(0,15),W); label(&quot;a&quot;,(0,45),W); label(&quot;b&quot;,(20,0),S); label(&quot;b&quot;,(60,0),S);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"195\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c6255c98ff411fe12be098e1cae7912114cdae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = MO = MX$\" width=\"127\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/1/0a1b1c3c404398467a9fe724f905e74fb6a4c741.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = NO = NY$\" width=\"118\" height=\"12\" />.  By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pythagorean_Theorem\" title=\"Pythagorean Theorem\">Pythagorean Theorem</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e0c29e184f74d5b6f794e81ef73ad09f7c2ddae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a^2 + b^2 = 22^2\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/6/286fc04cd237f54d2629539688b502c965a94caa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 + 4b^2 = 31^2\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />\nAdd the two equations to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/3/6a3fc3295a5fd238c5717bbd5e520188758947e6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a^2 + 5b^2 = 22^2 + 31^2\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/0/ea0fd439fac15ba479c734b318b42484139970a4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5a^2 + 5b^2 = 1445\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />\nMultiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/3228dfcd2deffb33728589e447feec78eb014d2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" /> to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/1877357d5299a71e85272e631a6dfd9dd974db9c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a^2 + 4b^2 = 1156\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d04e1bfb6ec0b772d3534202afd8f847804c711a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2a)^2 + (2b)^2 = 1156\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"19\" />\nThus, the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f8253e706cf96e266b563ec8edf39d1349799dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{1156} = \\boxed{34}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_55&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"200